"] ". Five nations won medals, but the United States players won all five events, while France won four medals (three silvers and " [:a {:href "/results/44847"} "a bronze"] "). The events were held at the " [:a {:href "/venues/268"} "Stade Tennis de Colombes"] ", in Colombes, slightly north of Paris."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/44715"} "Singles, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "13 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "82"] "\n" [:td {} "27"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/44847"} "Doubles, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "14 – 21 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "76"] "\n" [:td {} "24"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/44913"} "Singles, Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "13 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "31"] "\n" [:td {} "14"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/44979"} "Doubles, Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "14 – 19 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "22"] "\n" [:td {} "8"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/45001"} "Doubles, Mixed"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "14 – 21 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "42"] "\n" [:td {} "14"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n124 (89/35)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n27 (27/14)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {:class "top"} [:a {:href "/results/44715"} "Singles, Men"]]